//   Gaia was built to counter Selis. Cronus was built to counter Vrak.
//
// 12 Noble Treasures — split into 2 groups:
//   6 Grand Table (Sol-Nexus)  — Vrak's 3 Beasts (Seats I–III) + Selis's 3 Tools (Seats IV–VI)
//     Vrak Beasts:  Ruin (Clan Vael) · Eclipse (Clan Ashveil) · Erasure (Clan Nullar)
//     Selis Tools:  Sova's Chain (Clan Sovenne) · Keth's Brand (Clan Kethis) · Tevan's Edict (Clan Tevanis)
